hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15936","Ibn Numayr narrated to us, he said, Isma'il ibn Ibrahim, meaning Ibn Muhajir, narrated to us, from Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr, from Amr ibn Hurayth, he said, my brother Sa'id ibn Hurayth narrated to me, he said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: Whoever sells a property, it is likely no blessing will be given to him unless he puts it into its like or other than it."
